\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Janine clearly explains the experimental status, unauthorised use and risks.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 She tells Pin Cushion, \'93I can get you on a trial immediately.\'94 The statement serves the mother, not necessarily the truth.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Dialogue is character action. Never promote a character statement automatically into narrative fact.\cell \row

