\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Establish disease through lived experience, then systematically supply the medical facts.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The physical sequence does most of the work; the later medical paragraph is compressed background rather than a second scene.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Once the reader understands the consequence, technical information can be brief.\cell \row

