\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Explain why local dosing works, then explain possible integration, probably with an analogy.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Janine gives a few pieces. Pin Cushion makes the inference herself.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Give the reader enough pieces to complete the mechanism. Do not complete it twice.\cell \row

