\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Use the zipper to make the integration mechanism accessible.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 No zipper is necessary. Pin Cushion understands the real concept.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 If an analogy exists only to make exposition easier, first see whether the exposition can simply be removed.\cell \row

