\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Pin Cushion asks age-appropriate questions about pain, needles, danger and legality.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 She understands treatment persistence, underlying pathology and genomic incorporation, then says \'93Ouchies?\'94\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Age appears through register and priorities, not compulsory ignorance.\cell \row

