\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Risk disclosure deserves a substantial beat.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The present draft hasn't paid that bill yet\'97and may never pay all of it explicitly.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 A planning requirement is not an exposition requirement.\cell \row

