\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'93No more needles\'94 is a later payoff.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 It is already planted naturally inside the 
\f3\i perverse purse
\f2\i0  riff.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Allow later payoffs to grow out of accidental-looking earlier material rather than announcing motifs.\cell \row

