\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Longevity belongs in the final reveal.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Pin Cushion already knows enough to joke about being a three-hundred-year-old zombie.\cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Later scene need only supply what has actually changed: persistence, not the whole TPlus proposition again.\cell \row

